WEBVTT

00:09.480 --> 00:14.910
<b>Saving 80,000 Gold
in Another World 
for My Retirement</b>

01:29.980 --> 01:32.980
Producing a Socialite!

01:35.420 --> 01:36.780
Welcome!

01:40.180 --> 01:42.140
I brought my sous-chef with me, as well.

01:42.950 --> 01:45.600
Thank you all for coming.

01:45.600 --> 01:48.960
I'm the owner of General Store 
Mitsuha, Mitsuha Yamano.

01:51.440 --> 01:53.720
<i>No introductions from our guests.</i>

01:53.720 --> 01:56.880
<i>Tonight is nothing but an informal dinner.</i>

01:57.510 --> 02:01.850
<i>On the face of it, Marcel's just brought 
his friends to a familiar eatery.</i>

02:01.850 --> 02:03.490
Please, come in.

02:04.690 --> 02:08.580
<i>We can talk business once we've 
moved on to the next phase.</i>

02:10.920 --> 02:15.480
<i>The debutante ball for Miss Adelaide, 
daughter of Viscount Reiner.</i>

02:16.750 --> 02:19.530
<i>Whether or not I can take 
on such a huge endeavor...</i>

02:20.260 --> 02:22.250
<i>all depends on how this tasting goes!</i>

02:24.450 --> 02:27.620
Today, you'll be sampling 
a variety of dishes.

02:28.010 --> 02:29.610
It'll just be all sorts of cuisine.

02:29.610 --> 02:30.970
Will that be all right?

02:33.080 --> 02:34.960
<i>Okay, let's begin!</i>

02:36.450 --> 02:38.260
First up is a consommé.

02:38.830 --> 02:42.010
<i>The masterwork of a chef from 
a famous French restaurant!</i>

02:42.010 --> 02:44.470
<b>Consommé</b>

02:42.010 --> 02:44.470
<b>Meatballs</b>

02:42.010 --> 02:44.470
<i>Ah, I warmed it up.</i>

03:00.730 --> 03:04.740
There's more on the way, 
so please try them at your leisure.

03:23.290 --> 03:25.600
These aren't dishes 
from this country, are they?

03:26.060 --> 03:29.850
No, they're from my home 
country and its neighbors.

03:30.810 --> 03:32.060
And the chef?

03:32.750 --> 03:34.370
A compatriot of mine.

03:34.370 --> 03:38.080
After firmly swearing that 
I wouldn't ask for more than samples,

03:38.080 --> 03:39.790
I was able to twist their arm just this once.

03:39.790 --> 03:43.070
S-So how can we learn to make these dishes?!

03:43.450 --> 03:45.280
I can procure the recipes.

03:45.720 --> 03:48.510
With lots of practice, 
you can achieve these flavors.

03:48.510 --> 03:51.780
Please commit to memory 
the taste of these finished dishes!

03:51.780 --> 03:52.920
What?!

03:52.920 --> 03:54.680
What of the ingredients?

03:54.680 --> 03:55.860
The fish especially.

03:55.860 --> 03:58.550
Will you share how you managed 
to transport them?

03:58.550 --> 04:01.240
I'll take care of all that.

04:01.240 --> 04:03.730
That's what General Store Mitsuha's here for,

04:03.730 --> 04:06.300
as part of our ask-anything consultation center!

04:08.820 --> 04:10.930
This wouldn't fall under product sales,

04:10.930 --> 04:15.960
but rather services rendered for 
a solution to your consultation matter.

04:15.960 --> 04:18.820
With necessary expenses being 
a separate charge, of course!

04:22.170 --> 04:23.280
Miss Mitsuha.

04:23.280 --> 04:25.320
I'd love to contract your services!

04:26.760 --> 04:30.230
Your contractual obligations will be
providing ingredients and cuisine instruction.

04:30.230 --> 04:31.410
I'd like to ask that of you.

04:33.220 --> 04:34.420
I refuse!

04:34.420 --> 04:35.460
What?!

04:35.800 --> 04:39.460
Ah, I don't mind accepting the cooking part.

04:39.890 --> 04:43.030
But that alone wouldn't be very interesting.

04:43.030 --> 04:44.480
What do you mean?

04:44.480 --> 04:46.360
Could you entrust the dress,

04:46.360 --> 04:48.640
performance direction, 
and everything else to me?

04:49.310 --> 04:51.350
Exactly what are you planning?

04:51.760 --> 04:55.810
I have an idea for a production 
to let your daughter reach greater heights.

04:57.350 --> 05:00.570
Could you explain this so-called 
production beforehand?

05:00.570 --> 05:01.780
Of course.

05:01.780 --> 05:04.820
We'll hold a rehearsal as well, 
so you can review it then.

05:06.810 --> 05:09.780
I understand. 
We'll leave it all to you, Miss Mitsuha.

05:10.110 --> 05:11.680
Thank you very much.

05:12.330 --> 05:13.760
Miss Mitsuha!

05:13.760 --> 05:16.610
Can I take today's meal back home with me?!

05:16.610 --> 05:19.540
I'll work hard to get even 
a little closer to this flavor!

05:19.540 --> 05:22.760
So I can have absolute confidence as a chef!

05:23.120 --> 05:26.640
Yes! Be sure to eat it before it spoils.

05:30.510 --> 05:33.180
Now then, we'll be 
taking our leave for today.

05:33.540 --> 05:35.180
Thank you for your business!

05:35.180 --> 05:36.350
Eep!

05:37.420 --> 05:39.450
I-Is something the matter?

05:39.450 --> 05:43.140
Sell me some of that hair 
and body cleanse elixir, as well!

05:43.140 --> 05:45.590
Ah, the shampoo and body wash?

05:45.590 --> 05:46.580
Actually...

05:46.580 --> 05:49.850
We have a deluxe version 
for nobles in stock, as well!

05:49.850 --> 05:52.120
I'll be taking those, then.

05:53.160 --> 05:54.830
<i>I jacked up the price.</i>

05:55.150 --> 05:57.270
Thank you for your business!

05:58.920 --> 06:01.790
<i>All right, everything's going as planned.</i>

06:08.980 --> 06:10.930
Time to begin preparations!

06:10.930 --> 06:15.810
It'd be unthinkable to not have 
enough food at a party for aristocrats.

06:16.530 --> 06:21.070
I think we should prepare double the amount 
that would suffice for a normal party.

06:21.070 --> 06:22.130
I see...

06:21.810 --> 06:24.270
Delicious Recipes

06:21.900 --> 06:24.270
<b>The book you need for picture-perfect cooking!!{yellow top text}</b>

06:22.130 --> 06:24.980
<i>So we need to choose dishes 
that are delicious and make an impact,</i>

06:24.980 --> 06:28.780
<i>all while being easy 
to prepare in large quantities.</i>

06:31.180 --> 06:35.340
<i>I'm actually pretty good 
at cooking, you know.</i>

06:35.820 --> 06:37.080
Coach!

06:37.540 --> 06:39.540
About the heat strength here...

06:42.780 --> 06:44.040
How is it, Coach?

06:44.440 --> 06:46.880
Coach, please take a look here, as well.

06:46.880 --> 06:48.620
Coach, over here!

06:48.620 --> 06:50.000
Coach, how about this?

06:50.000 --> 06:50.940
Coach! Coach!

06:50.940 --> 06:51.770
Coach!

06:52.610 --> 06:55.640
<i>Coach, huh? It's got a nice ring to it...</i>

06:55.640 --> 06:56.770
Okay!

06:57.820 --> 07:00.090
Cooking is mastered 
through experience, Marcel!

07:00.090 --> 07:03.740
Overcome these trials 
and become a true chef!

07:03.740 --> 07:05.160
Yes, Coach!

07:14.540 --> 07:15.990
My lady!

07:15.990 --> 07:18.350
Ah, is it time already?

07:18.350 --> 07:20.660
All right, good luck 
with the rest of your practice.

07:20.660 --> 07:21.360
Yes.

07:27.390 --> 07:30.170
Your bodyguards will have to wait out here.

07:30.630 --> 07:34.630
I'll be taking measurements 
to make the dress, so no men allowed!

07:36.290 --> 07:38.600
Please watch your step.

07:39.860 --> 07:41.180
Come now, this way.

07:42.580 --> 07:45.140
But first, please excuse me.

07:45.140 --> 07:46.800
Ah! Wh-What are you doing?!

07:46.800 --> 07:48.320
It's a magic spell.

07:49.170 --> 07:50.280
Right this way, my lady.

07:51.910 --> 07:53.490
And now to jump worlds!

07:56.030 --> 07:58.740
<b>Maiden Couture</b>

07:56.750 --> 07:58.740
Welcome to Earth!

08:03.280 --> 08:04.420
One moment, please.

08:06.860 --> 08:07.880
Hello there!

08:08.200 --> 08:10.390
Yes, yes, yes!

08:11.440 --> 08:13.260
A drop-dead beauty, in the house!

08:13.800 --> 08:16.090
We're short on time, 
so if you could get to measuring.

08:16.090 --> 08:19.600
Ah, do try not to show her any disrespect.

08:19.600 --> 08:21.740
I-I'll be good!

08:21.740 --> 08:25.600
She's a fine lady from some 
foreign upper-crust family, right?

08:25.600 --> 08:26.360
Come now.

08:26.360 --> 08:28.320
This way, my lady.

08:28.320 --> 08:31.530
You'll be fine. 
Her skills are the real deal.

08:32.610 --> 08:36.030
Oh, my! Well now, 
what do we have here?

08:36.030 --> 08:38.270
<i>H-Hey, will she really be okay?</i>

08:38.270 --> 08:39.270
I can't get enough!

08:39.850 --> 08:43.750
Ah! My imagination's running wild!

08:44.220 --> 08:45.210
How about this?

08:45.210 --> 08:46.070
Well? Well?

08:46.970 --> 08:48.070
And this?

08:48.690 --> 08:50.060
Or this approach!

08:50.060 --> 08:51.570
Oh, now there's a curveball!

08:51.570 --> 08:54.010
Then, I'll let you handle 
the necessary props, as well!

08:54.010 --> 08:55.300
You got it!

08:55.300 --> 08:58.260
What an honor to deal with 
a request like this!

08:58.260 --> 09:00.450
What utter bliss!

09:00.980 --> 09:01.850
Ah...

09:02.280 --> 09:05.310
I'll go get some tea. Hold on a minute.

09:06.910 --> 09:09.960
Ah, she really is good at her job.

09:09.960 --> 09:12.060
So don't worry, Adelaide.

09:13.270 --> 09:14.540
Of course.

09:17.100 --> 09:19.710
Father, Mother, Marcel...

09:19.710 --> 09:23.000
They're all worried on my behalf 
and doing what they can.

09:23.660 --> 09:26.710
I won't allow this to end in failure.

09:27.220 --> 09:30.170
I'll save my gratitude 
until after it's all over.

09:31.070 --> 09:33.130
Now <i>she's</i> a feisty one!

09:37.260 --> 09:40.550
<i>Yep... I can't let this be a failure.</i>

09:41.730 --> 09:43.520
<i>For Adelaide's sake!</i>

09:57.300 --> 09:58.530
Time to try it.

10:03.940 --> 10:05.710
Yeah, this is great!

10:05.710 --> 10:08.930
My constant training day 
after day really paid off!

10:09.360 --> 10:11.380
Thank you so much, Coach!

10:17.650 --> 10:19.220
Oh, I almost forgot...

10:19.870 --> 10:22.580
<i>The shop's been closed this whole time.</i>

10:22.580 --> 10:24.050
<i>Well, whatever.</i>

10:24.050 --> 10:27.940
<i>I'm sure I wouldn't get any customers 
outside of the Reiner household.</i>

10:29.880 --> 10:31.770
<i>I'll make my name with this job.</i>

10:32.520 --> 10:33.520
<i>Yeah!</i>

10:39.850 --> 10:41.390
<i>And so, it's finally here!</i>

10:41.390 --> 10:43.470
<i>The day of her coming-out party!</i>

10:44.030 --> 10:46.660
There's not a lot being served here.

10:46.660 --> 10:47.260
Hmph.

10:47.260 --> 10:50.390
House Reiner is nothing 
more than new aristocracy.

10:50.390 --> 10:53.020
I'm sure this was the best they could do.

10:53.470 --> 10:54.630
Everyone.

10:56.150 --> 10:59.040
I'm very glad to see you here.

10:59.920 --> 11:02.390
You have my utmost gratitude 
for being here today.

11:03.190 --> 11:08.800
I hope you will join me in celebrating 
my daughter Adelaide's coming-of-age.

11:09.400 --> 11:10.400
Without further ado...

11:15.630 --> 11:16.720
Ah! A fire?

11:16.720 --> 11:17.790
No, that's not it.

11:17.790 --> 11:19.570
Oh, it's just the entertainment.

11:22.120 --> 11:25.030
Ah, ah... Ladies and gentlemen.

11:25.030 --> 11:27.040
Wh-Where's that voice coming from?

11:27.640 --> 11:29.990
Thank you for joining us

11:29.990 --> 11:34.790
for the unveiling of the pride of the 
Reiner family, the flower fairy Adelaide!

11:35.570 --> 11:38.510
Now behold her in all her beauty!

11:39.000 --> 11:41.390
<i>Okay! It begins here!</i>

11:41.970 --> 11:44.970
<b>Saving 80,000 Gold in
Another World 
for My Retirement</b>

11:44.970 --> 11:48.020
<b>Saving 80,000 Gold in
Another World 
for My Retirement</b>

11:48.730 --> 11:52.060
Miss Adelaide's debut!

11:55.730 --> 11:57.690
Oh!

12:04.220 --> 12:06.370
Do you think you can catch me?

12:08.080 --> 12:10.890
What beauty and charm!

12:11.360 --> 12:13.370
She really is like a fairy!

12:13.370 --> 12:15.050
Hey, check out that dress!

12:15.050 --> 12:16.580
Delicate yet striking...

12:16.580 --> 12:19.000
An innovative dress 
unlike anything I've seen!

12:19.540 --> 12:22.220
<i>All right! This part's a success!</i>

12:22.220 --> 12:24.500
How strange, though.

12:24.500 --> 12:27.690
I could have sworn I saw 
a field of flowers before me.

12:27.690 --> 12:29.180
I saw a fairy, as well!

12:29.180 --> 12:31.480
What was that? An apparition?

12:32.370 --> 12:36.100
<i>The flower field and fairies 
are being projected onto the wall.</i>

12:36.660 --> 12:40.530
<i>The smoke I made by splashing 
hot water onto a load of dry ice.</i>

12:41.540 --> 12:43.860
<i>Modern technology's really helping me out!</i>

12:43.860 --> 12:49.210
<i>Although having her memorize lines proved 
difficult, so I'm dubbing over everything.</i>

12:50.230 --> 12:53.500
<i>Okay, time for the maid army 
to show off their special training!</i>

12:53.500 --> 12:55.500
<i>Adelaide's quick costume change!</i>

12:56.870 --> 12:58.460
And a click here, as well!

13:00.920 --> 13:03.770
Just how are they doing this?

13:03.770 --> 13:07.760
A group of bandits awaiting the lord's 
absence to ransack the populace.

13:08.260 --> 13:10.920
Only a small number of troops remained...

13:14.610 --> 13:18.690
How different from a moment ago, 
so gallant and handsome!

13:19.650 --> 13:22.250
My lady, the thieves are approaching.

13:22.250 --> 13:23.600
Please escape!

13:24.700 --> 13:29.120
It is my duty to protect 
the people in my father's stead.

13:29.460 --> 13:32.870
I see. They're putting 
on this sort of show now.

13:32.870 --> 13:36.710
There are some battles you 
just can't back down from.

13:37.580 --> 13:40.080
I'll lose something precious 
if I run away here.

13:40.700 --> 13:43.220
A battle with my pride at stake!

13:44.260 --> 13:45.990
I will not retreat!

13:47.890 --> 13:48.970
Face my wrath!

13:56.430 --> 13:57.260
<i>Okay!</i>

13:57.260 --> 14:01.820
<i>The divine sword I bought in Akihabara 
for 18,000 yen is looking good!</i>

14:01.820 --> 14:04.300
<i>Okay, the final costume change!</i>

14:08.260 --> 14:12.290
<i>She needs to go off and mingle, 
so this one's a normal dress.</i>

14:12.290 --> 14:14.460
<i>But it's the manager's pièce de résistance.</i>

14:15.440 --> 14:17.640
As of today, I'm no longer a fairy.

14:17.640 --> 14:20.240
From here on out, 
I'll do my best in high society!

14:20.240 --> 14:22.760
Everyone, please treat me kindly!

14:29.590 --> 14:32.840
<i>It's over! You did well, Adelaide!</i>

14:33.820 --> 14:35.060
<i>Now for...</i>

14:35.670 --> 14:39.520
Well then, please relax 
and enjoy some conversation.

14:40.000 --> 14:44.170
In addition, while we've prepared 
a traditional meal for each table,

14:44.170 --> 14:46.840
separately, at the back 
of the banquet hall...

14:48.260 --> 14:52.000
We've assembled a variety 
of rare foods from distant nations.

14:52.470 --> 14:56.090
We'd love for any who are interested 
to sample these offerings.

14:56.090 --> 14:59.960
I see, so that's why the meals 
at our table were so meager.

15:01.020 --> 15:03.900
Foreign cuisine wouldn't be 
to everyone's taste.

15:04.330 --> 15:06.590
They've really thought this through.

15:09.140 --> 15:09.760
What?!

15:09.760 --> 15:11.980
Is this fish I see?!

15:11.980 --> 15:13.600
It's not dried fish, either!

15:13.600 --> 15:15.060
And is this raw fish I spy?!

15:15.060 --> 15:16.720
I-Is this safe to eat?

15:17.240 --> 15:18.780
Wouldn't it go bad?

15:19.940 --> 15:23.630
<i>No, this fish is clearly as fresh as can be!</i>

15:23.630 --> 15:27.480
<i>I'll have Viscount Reiner's house 
owe me a debt of gratitude here!</i>

15:36.840 --> 15:38.950
I-It's delicious!

15:42.050 --> 15:43.420
M-My word...

15:43.420 --> 15:44.880
How delightful!

15:44.880 --> 15:46.580
Oh, it's simply scrumptious!

15:46.580 --> 15:48.400
This is great, as well.

15:48.400 --> 15:50.490
<i>All right, looking good!</i>

15:50.490 --> 15:54.340
<i>When things go this well, 
I can't help but worry we'll hit a snag—</i>

15:54.340 --> 15:55.370
Eek!

15:56.070 --> 15:58.690
Just what are you doing?

16:01.110 --> 16:06.500
Just what are you doing 
in a place like this, Mitsuha?

16:06.500 --> 16:07.730
Lady Iris!

16:07.730 --> 16:08.710
<i>That's right!</i>

16:08.710 --> 16:13.220
<i>This party means that now 
is the season for social functions!</i>

16:13.220 --> 16:18.910
<i>Shoot! It completely slipped my mind!</i>

16:18.910 --> 16:20.370
Mitsuha?!

16:21.350 --> 16:24.680
It's been so long, 
Count Bozes, Sir Theodore.

16:24.680 --> 16:25.270
So?

16:25.270 --> 16:29.920
How come you refused to live in our manor, 
and yet you're in a place like this?

16:29.920 --> 16:31.380
<i>Wow, those eyes are scary!</i>

16:31.820 --> 16:33.450
I visited your shop countless times!

16:33.450 --> 16:35.160
But it's always been closed and empty!

16:35.160 --> 16:37.240
Do you know how worried I was?!

16:37.240 --> 16:39.870
And to think you'd be idling 
away in a place like this!

16:39.870 --> 16:44.350
<i>Viscount Reiner's standing sure 
is evident by how she refers to his manor.</i>

16:44.350 --> 16:47.680
No, I'm here on store business.

16:47.680 --> 16:51.300
I'm not in their debt or living here!

16:52.500 --> 16:55.320
H-Huh? That reminds me, where's Lord Alexis?

16:56.390 --> 16:58.200
My brother's there, look.

16:59.490 --> 17:02.370
I was captivated by your 
sight earlier, my lady.

17:02.370 --> 17:04.450
I thought you a fairy or a goddess!

17:04.450 --> 17:07.880
I swear, he's like that with everyone.

17:07.880 --> 17:09.120
That's the eldest son for you.

17:09.120 --> 17:11.470
He knows just what to do 
at a time like this.

17:11.470 --> 17:12.010
Huh?

17:12.010 --> 17:15.200
Today is Miss Adelaide's coming-of-age.

17:15.200 --> 17:19.150
No man in his right mind would ignore 
the star of the night to talk with other girls.

17:19.150 --> 17:20.160
Right?

17:20.160 --> 17:24.350
Personal feelings aside, it's proper 
etiquette to speak with her.

17:25.290 --> 17:27.150
I-I'll be right back!

17:31.120 --> 17:32.150
In any case!

17:32.150 --> 17:34.110
Please come visit us as soon as you can!

17:34.110 --> 17:35.860
I understand.

17:36.320 --> 17:37.890
Eek!

17:37.890 --> 17:39.280
<i>Who is it now?</i>

17:39.710 --> 17:41.820
C-Coach, it's awful.

17:41.820 --> 17:43.540
The food... the food...

17:44.070 --> 17:46.250
There's not enough food!

17:46.250 --> 17:47.960
Wh-What?!

17:48.330 --> 17:50.080
But we prepared plenty!

17:50.080 --> 17:53.620
Both you and Marcel gave your approval 
and said we'd have more than enough!

17:53.620 --> 17:55.020
What's going on?!

17:55.020 --> 17:57.740
We'd surely have leftovers 
in normal circumstances.

17:57.740 --> 18:01.460
But for whatever reason, no one is leaving!

17:57.970 --> 18:01.460
Ah, that really was a fine play they put on.

18:01.460 --> 18:04.430
There might still be more 
entertainment in store!

18:04.960 --> 18:07.390
<i>Oh, no! We went overboard.</i>

18:07.390 --> 18:10.640
This foreign cuisine is truly delightful!

18:10.640 --> 18:14.780
I never dreamed I'd get to 
try such rare foods.

18:15.340 --> 18:19.660
<i>Not preparing enough food 
for guests is an act of disgrace!</i>

18:19.660 --> 18:24.660
<i>They'll be branded as penniless nobles, 
unable to provide any better food!</i>

18:24.660 --> 18:27.040
<i>A massive blunder 
that mustn't become a reality!</i>

18:28.100 --> 18:31.620
<i>And what's more, 
this is Adelaide's debut party.</i>

18:31.620 --> 18:35.120
<i>If that happens, Adelaide's future will...</i>

18:36.110 --> 18:39.590
Count, Lady Iris! 
I'm sorry, but I must take my leave!

18:42.500 --> 18:44.560
<i>In any case, this is an emergency!</i>

18:50.250 --> 18:52.810
We're out of yellowtail fillets.

18:52.810 --> 18:55.640
This is the last of the sushi fish.

18:56.030 --> 18:58.540
<i>I've gotta do something! Anything!</i>

18:59.490 --> 19:04.450
<i>Those potatoes haven't been prepped at all, 
which means they're surplus ingredients!</i>

19:04.450 --> 19:06.330
Is the oil hot?

19:06.330 --> 19:07.240
Yeah...

19:08.550 --> 19:09.910
Snap out of it!

19:09.910 --> 19:13.120
Peel these potatoes, 
slice them, and fry them in oil!

19:13.120 --> 19:15.420
You remember the dish we rejected, right?

19:15.420 --> 19:17.150
We're gonna make that!

19:17.150 --> 19:20.390
It's the perfect dish to make 
quickly in large batches!

19:20.390 --> 19:23.200
You remember how to make 
them, don't you, Marcel?

19:23.200 --> 19:24.640
Y-Yeah...

19:24.640 --> 19:26.580
What are you wasting time for?!

19:26.580 --> 19:31.260
Didn't you swear you wouldn't 
embarrass your lord and his daughter?!

19:31.260 --> 19:35.620
There's nothing scarier 
than breaking that vow, is there?!

19:37.010 --> 19:39.610
We'll quickly put something together 
with what we've got here!

19:39.610 --> 19:41.570
Rummage through the entire storehouse!

19:41.570 --> 19:42.470
Hurry!

19:43.110 --> 19:45.490
Think of what we could make from those!

19:45.490 --> 19:48.380
Something that can be made easily 
and quickly in large quantities!

19:48.380 --> 19:50.930
Aristocrats don't know anything 
about commoner food!

19:50.930 --> 19:52.830
We can just say it's exotic cuisine!

19:53.390 --> 19:56.590
I'll buy us some time, 
so get ready in the meantime!

19:56.590 --> 20:01.350
<i>I'd prepared these for after the party 
to celebrate with the household...</i>

20:01.340 --> 20:03.550
Lamonde

20:01.350 --> 20:02.640
<i>But I'll use these!</i>

20:01.350 --> 20:03.550
White Yollita

20:04.230 --> 20:05.290
Change of plans!

20:05.290 --> 20:07.150
Bring out all the desserts, right away!

20:07.150 --> 20:08.010
Yes!

20:10.480 --> 20:14.130
Apologies for interrupting 
everyone's conversation.

20:14.690 --> 20:17.490
We're about to begin 
the second course of exotic foods,

20:17.490 --> 20:21.110
with accompaniments for alcohol, 
as well as desserts.

20:23.610 --> 20:26.850
<i>And most of those desserts 
are the ones I've brought with me!</i>

20:26.850 --> 20:28.780
<i>Feast upon the ultimate weapon!</i>

20:28.780 --> 20:32.750
<i>Face the power of my country's 
confectionery industry!</i>

20:33.650 --> 20:35.350
This is also tasty!

20:36.940 --> 20:38.170
Mmm, it's great!

20:39.510 --> 20:43.160
These are an exotic dish 
known as French fries.

20:46.540 --> 20:47.540
Goodness me!

20:47.540 --> 20:50.210
The entertainment 
and food were both splendid!

20:50.210 --> 20:53.530
Not to mention how lovely Miss Adelaide was.

20:53.530 --> 20:55.960
Maybe I should put some pressure on my son.

20:55.960 --> 21:02.000
And I can't imagine the wealth and 
influence you'd need to pull all this off!

21:02.000 --> 21:07.240
It seems that Viscount Reiner's house 
can't be dismissed as new aristocracy.

21:20.180 --> 21:21.140
<i>I did it!</i>

21:21.140 --> 21:23.830
<i>My first job for the consultation 
center's a big success!</i>

21:25.580 --> 21:29.940
You mean our daughter's debutante 
ball will have to fare against this?!

21:31.060 --> 21:36.060
<i>Our success ended up causing distress 
for noble houses with adolescent daughters.</i>

21:36.590 --> 21:39.920
<i>Also, the food tonight 
ended up becoming a sensation,</i>

21:39.920 --> 21:44.940
<i>and would eventually end up 
becoming known as "Yamano cuisine"...</i>

21:44.940 --> 21:48.710
<i>But that's a story for another day.</i>
